; abnf stdio.html snapshot (pack/binary payload)
; payload is UTF-8 HTML5 text (this codec's canonical form -- HTML has no separate
; "compact"/"pretty" distinction the way JSON does, since inter-tag whitespace is significant text
; content) -- see ../📝️text/📖️component.grammar.semio for the full grammar.
document = html-text
html-text = *OCTET
